  "input_redacted": "Claim [CLAIM NUMBER REDACTED]. Business interruption event on 26 June 2026; the insured's risk manager only notified the Insurer 52 days later. Claimed amount GBP 151,758. Insured asks whether the late notice affects the claim.",
  "redacted_fields": [
