  "input_redacted": "Claim [CLAIM NUMBER REDACTED]. Flood loss on 05 April 2026. During the claim visit the loss adjuster found the insured's sump pumps had not been tested in the preceding nine months, against the six-month testing condition. No test log was produced. Estimated damage GBP 203,570. Insured asks whether this affects the claim.",
